# Prettier runs from the repository root (`pnpm format`), so this one file
# covers every package; package-level .prettierignore files are no longer read
# and were removed.

# Prose is curated by hand. Prettier's markdown printer rewrites fenced code
# (it expands the minified plugin-card CSS in AGENTS.md and adds semicolons to
# TypeScript examples) and pads every table cell, which is churn rather than
# formatting.
*.md

# YAML is hand-written configuration whose exact text is pinned from both sides:
# CI tests assert the quoting in the workflows, package verification asserts the
# `name:` quoting in cordis.patch.yml, and pnpm writes its own quoting into the
# lockfile and the workspace catalogs. Prettier's only contribution there is
# flipping quotes.
*.yml
*.yaml

# Regenerated by `nx release` on every release, so checking it is a treadmill.
CHANGELOG.md

# Build output and local caches, also ignored by git.
lib/
dist/
coverage/
node_modules/
.nx/

# Machine-local workspace (leak-scan tooling, slice backups). It is ignored
# through .git/info/exclude, which Prettier does not read, so it needs its own
# entry or every machine with local files there fails `pnpm format`.
.private/
